{"unit":10,"items":54,"pass":38,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 10","tracks":{"a103":"Track_10.3.mp3"},"SEGS":{"ann":["a103",3.89,86.15]},"html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 10 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Compete and cooperate</h2>\n      <p>Six parts, <b>54 questions</b>, covering everything in Unit 10, with four questions that come back from Units 1&ndash;9. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>38 out of 54</b> to pass. Parts 7 and 8 are your writing and speaking &mdash; they are not marked automatically, but do not skip them. You can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u10\">\n\n      <!-- ============ PART 1 · VOCABULARY ============ -->\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;12</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the word that fits.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Nothing is taken from anybody unless the target is reached. Money is only&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">manufactured</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">pledged</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">renovated</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">The old warehouses were empty for years. The whole area was&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">vibrant</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">fashionable</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">run-down</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">She has broken her own&hellip; in every race this season.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">record</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">riot</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">figure</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">An open-air cinema in that district would have been&hellip; ten years ago.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">demotivating</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">unheard of</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">non-competitive</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Complete each phrase with <b>take</b>. Match the beginning to the ending.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5&ndash;9</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"pairbox\">\n          <div class=\"pcol\">\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"l\" data-key=\"n1\">take a</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"l\" data-key=\"n2\">take</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"l\" data-key=\"n3\">take part</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"l\" data-key=\"n4\">take advantage</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"l\" data-key=\"n5\">take somebody</button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pcol\">\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"r\" data-key=\"n3\" data-short=\"in a contest\">in a contest</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"r\" data-key=\"n5\" data-short=\"seriously\">seriously</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"r\" data-key=\"n1\" data-short=\"risk\">risk</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"r\" data-key=\"n4\" data-short=\"of the weather\">of the weather</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"r\" data-key=\"n2\" data-short=\"turns\">turns</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Complete each sentence with one word from the box: <b>dramatically &middot; investors &middot; destination</b>.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">Visitor numbers have risen <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"dramatically\" data-why=\"A very large change &rarr; <b>dramatically</b>.\"> since 2016.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">No profit is guaranteed to <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"investors\" data-why=\"<b>Investors</b> are the people who put money in.\"> at any stage.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">The district has become a <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"destination\" data-why=\"A <b>destination</b> = a place people go to on purpose.\"> rather than somewhere people drove through.</span></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ PART 2 · GRAMMAR ============ -->\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 13&ndash;26</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct passive form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">This model&hellip; in Almaty, not in China.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is manufacture</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">manufactures</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">is manufactured</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">The prototype&hellip; at the moment, so we cannot show it to you.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is being tested</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">is testing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">has tested</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">More than twenty billion dollars&hellip; in this way since 2009.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">has raised</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">has been raised</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">is raised</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">The hat&hellip; over your head so that you can sleep.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">can pull</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">can been pulled</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">can be pulled</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the article: <b>a/an</b>, <b>the</b>, or none at all.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">___ children learn faster than adults. <select data-answer=\"Z\" data-why=\"A general statement about children &rarr; no article.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"A\">A</option><option value=\"Z\">no article</option><option value=\"T\">The</option></select></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">She wants to be ___ referee in the district league. <select data-answer=\"A\" data-why=\"A job, first mention &rarr; <b>a</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"A\">a</option><option value=\"T\">the</option><option value=\"Z\">no article</option></select></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">___ crowd went completely quiet. <select data-answer=\"T\" data-why=\"The definite crowd at that event &rarr; <b>The</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"A\">A</option><option value=\"Z\">no article</option><option value=\"T\">The</option></select></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">He is at ___ school &mdash; he is in year six. <select data-answer=\"Z\" data-why=\"<b>no article</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"T\">the</option><option value=\"Z\">no article</option><option value=\"A\">a</option></select></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Rewrite each sentence in the passive. Leave out the doer if it adds nothing.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">Somebody stole my bike last night.<br>My bike <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"was stolen last night\" data-why=\"Nobody knows who &rarr; leave the doer out.\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">They are raising the money through a website.<br>The money <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"is being raised through a website\" data-why=\"Happening around now &rarr; present continuous passive.\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\">They have not approved the loan.<br>The loan <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"hasn't been approved|has not been approved\" data-why=\"Present perfect passive, negative.\"></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Complete each sentence with the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\">The money has <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"been raised\" data-why=\"The passive needs the past participle: <b>been raised</b>.\"> already.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">Taking part in <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"competitive sport\" data-why=\"Talking about sport in general takes no article.\"> is not bad for self-esteem.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Write the second sentence so that it means the same as the first.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">Nobody guarantees investors a profit.<br>Investors <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"aren't guaranteed a profit|are not guaranteed a profit\" data-why=\"A verb with two objects can passivize on the person.\"></span></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ PART 3 · READING ============ -->\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Reading &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 27&ndash;34</span></div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Read the whole text once before you answer anything.</p>\n\n      <article class=\"reading\">\n        <h3>The prize that was never collected</h3>\n        <p class=\"stand\">A running race in the north of England has been won, most years, by somebody who takes no prize at all.</p>\n        <p><span class=\"pmark\">A</span>The race is held every September on the same hillside and has been run since 1954. It is organized by volunteers, entry costs almost nothing, and the trophy is a small tin cup that is handed back at the end of the evening. What has kept it going for seventy years is a rule that is printed on the entry form and is not explained anywhere: the winner of the men&rsquo;s race is not the fastest runner. It is the runner who finishes closest to the time they predicted before they started.</p>\n        <p><span class=\"pmark\">B</span>No watches are allowed. Runners write a time on a card, the cards are collected, and the times are compared afterwards. A fast athlete who is thirty seconds out will be beaten by somebody two minutes slower who was accurate to within five. In 2019 the race was won by a woman of seventy-one who had been running it since the 1970s and who missed her predicted time by four seconds.</p>\n        <p><span class=\"pmark\">C</span>The organizers say the rule was not invented for any philosophical reason. The first race was held between two farms, and nobody had a stopwatch. What was noticed later is that the field behaves differently. Nobody is overtaken and nobody sprints at the end, because sprinting would ruin your own prediction. People run beside each other and talk, which almost never happens in a competitive race.</p>\n        <p><span class=\"pmark\">D</span>Sports scientists have looked at it twice. Both times they concluded that the format measures something real &mdash; the ability to judge your own effort accurately &mdash; and that this skill is not related to speed and improves with age. Neither study changed anything at the race, where the tin cup is still handed back, and where the runner who came last in 2022 was also, that year, the winner.</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the best answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">How is the winner of the race decided?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">by the fastest time on the hillside</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">by a vote among the volunteers</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">by who is closest to the time they predicted</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\">Why was the rule originally introduced?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">because nobody at the first race had a stopwatch</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">because the organizers disliked competition</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">because scientists suggested it</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">True, False, or Not given? Choose for each sentence.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\">Runners are allowed to wear a watch during the race. <select data-answer=\"F\" data-why=\"Paragraph B: <b>False</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"T\">True</option><option value=\"N\">Not given</option><option value=\"F\">False</option></select></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">The 2019 winner had been taking part since the 1970s. <select data-answer=\"T\" data-why=\"Paragraph B says exactly that.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"T\">True</option><option value=\"N\">Not given</option><option value=\"F\">False</option></select></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">31</span><span class=\"body\">The race attracts runners from other countries. <select data-answer=\"N\" data-why=\"Where the runners come from is never mentioned.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"T\">True</option><option value=\"N\">Not given</option><option value=\"F\">False</option></select></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">32</span><span class=\"body\">The scientific studies led to changes in the rules. <select data-answer=\"F\" data-why=\"Paragraph D: <b>False</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"T\">True</option><option value=\"N\">Not given</option><option value=\"F\">False</option></select></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Answer the last two questions about the whole text.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">33</span><span class=\"body\">Why does nobody sprint at the end?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">the hill is too steep at that point</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">sprinting would spoil their own predicted time</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">it is against the rules of the club</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">34</span><span class=\"body\">The last sentence is included mainly to show that\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">being slowest and being the winner are not opposites here</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the race has become less popular</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the tin cup should be replaced</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ PART 4 · LISTENING ============ -->\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 4 &middot; Listening &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 35&ndash;40</span></div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Read the questions first. Then play the recording twice.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio\" onclick=\"playClip('ann',this,'Stop')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> The announcement about school sport\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Navigate B1+ &middot; Audio 10.3</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Complete the notes with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">35</span><span class=\"body\">The figures show that more and more children are <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"overweight\" data-why=\"The figures are about children being <b>overweight</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">36</span><span class=\"body\">Schools will take part in an <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"olympics-style event|olympic-style event|olympics-style|olympics style event\" data-why=\"An <b>Olympics-style event</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">37</span><span class=\"body\">The same skills are said to matter just as much in the <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"workplace\" data-why=\"They matter just as much in the <b>workplace</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the best answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">38</span><span class=\"body\">Which of these does the announcement actually say?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">competitive sports days and tournaments are to be re-introduced</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">yoga and trampolining are to be banned</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">losing a race damages children&rsquo;s self-esteem</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">39</span><span class=\"body\">According to the announcement, competitive sport teaches\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">how to avoid injury</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">how to eat properly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">teamwork and effort</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">40</span><span class=\"body\">What else is it hoped the plans will do?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">reduce the cost of school sport</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">help the country break more records</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">replace exams with sports results</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ PART 5 · FUNCTIONAL LANGUAGE ============ -->\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 5 &middot; Functional language &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 41&ndash;48</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">How big is the change? Choose the word that fits the figures.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">41</span><span class=\"body\">Visitors: 40,000 &rarr; 300,000. Numbers have risen <select data-answer=\"dramatically\" data-why=\"Almost eight times &mdash; a very large change.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>dramatically</option><option>slightly</option><option>a little</option></select> .</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">42</span><span class=\"body\">Museum entry: 1,000 &rarr; 1,100 tenge. The price has gone up <select data-answer=\"a bit\" data-why=\"Ten per cent &rarr; <b>a bit</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>sharply</option><option>enormously</option><option>a bit</option></select> .</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">43</span><span class=\"body\">Nightclubs: 40 &rarr; 12. There has been a <select data-answer=\"sharp fall\" data-why=\"A big drop &rarr; <b>sharp fall</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>slight fall</option><option>small rise</option><option>sharp fall</option></select> in their number.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Where does each line belong?</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">44&ndash;47</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"sortbox\">\n          <div class=\"sortpool\"><button class=\"swd\" data-col=\"Then\">It used to be completely run-down.</button><button class=\"swd\" data-col=\"Now\">These days the warehouses are hotels and a market.</button><button class=\"swd\" data-col=\"Then\">An open-air cinema here was unheard of.</button><button class=\"swd\" data-col=\"Now\">There has been a big increase in the number of visitors.</button></div>\n          <div class=\"sortcols\"><div class=\"sortcol\" data-col=\"Then\"><h5>How it used to be</h5><div class=\"drop\"></div></div><div class=\"sortcol\" data-col=\"Now\"><h5>How it is now</h5><div class=\"drop\"></div></div></div>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Put the four parts of the report in order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">48</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"p3,p1,p4,p2\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"p1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">It is a different place now: most of the warehouses have been renovated.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"p2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Whether that counts as an improvement depends entirely on which group you belong to.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"p3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Ten years ago the port district was run-down and empty after six o&rsquo;clock.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"p4\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">On the other hand, rents have tripled and most of the old families have moved out.</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ PART 6 · PUTTING IT TOGETHER ============ -->\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 6 &middot; Putting it together &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 49&ndash;54</span></div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Complete the conversation. Two of these gaps come back from earlier units. <span class=\"pill-rec\">recycled</span></p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"chat\">\n          <div class=\"msg\"><b>Aizhan</b>You went down to the old port at the weekend?</div>\n          <div class=\"msg you\"><b>You</b>Yes. Most of the warehouses <select data-answer=\"have been renovated\" data-why=\"A finished result, doer unimportant &rarr; present perfect passive.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>have been renovated</option><option>have renovated</option><option>are renovating</option></select> since I was last there.</div>\n          <div class=\"msg\"><b>Aizhan</b>Is it worth going?</div>\n          <div class=\"msg you\"><b>You</b>It is well worth a visit. <select data-answer=\"There&rsquo;s been a big increase\" data-why=\"The frame for describing a change in numbers.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>It used to increase</option><option>It is a big increasing</option><option>There&rsquo;s been a big increase</option></select> in the number of places to eat.</div>\n          <div class=\"msg\"><b>Aizhan</b>Expensive?</div>\n          <div class=\"msg you\"><b>You</b>Rents <select data-answer=\"have roughly tripled\" data-why=\"A finished result up to now &rarr; present perfect.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>are roughly tripling</option><option>have roughly tripled</option><option>roughly tripled since</option></select> in ten years. <select data-answer=\"On the other hand,\" data-why=\"Introduces the second side.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>For example,</option><option>These days,</option><option>On the other hand,</option></select> the market itself is cheap.</div>\n          <div class=\"msg\"><b>Aizhan</b>Who decided all this?</div>\n          <div class=\"msg you\"><b>You</b>Nobody knows. <span class=\"pill-rec\">recycled</span> The plan <select data-answer=\"must have been agreed\" data-why=\"A deduction about the past, in the passive. <b>must have been agreed</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>must have been agreed</option><option>must be agreed</option><option>mustn&rsquo;t have agreed</option></select> long before anybody was asked. <select data-answer=\"If they had asked\" data-why=\"An unreal past condition &rarr; past perfect. <b>If they had asked</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>If they asked</option><option>If they had asked</option><option>If they would have asked</option></select> us, half of it would look different.</div>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n\n    <!-- ============ PART 7 · WRITING ============ -->\n    <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:30px\">Part 7 &middot; Writing &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">assessed against the criteria</span></div>\n    <p class=\"subline\">Write 120&ndash;140 words. Give yourself twenty-five minutes.</p>\n    <div class=\"opentask\" data-open data-tid=\"test-write\">\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"body\">\n        <p class=\"ohint\"><b>The task.</b> Write a report on how one district, town or institution you know has changed in the last ten years. Say what it used to be like. Say what it is like now, with at least two figures. Say what actually made the difference. Then turn: say who has lost out. Finish with a one-line verdict that refuses to take a side.</p>\n        <textarea placeholder=\"Ten years ago&hellip;   It is a different place now.   There has been a big increase in&hellip;   On the other hand, not everybody has gained&hellip;   Whether that counts as an improvement&hellip;\" data-track></textarea>\n      </span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bubble useful\">\n      <div class=\"blab\">Your report must contain</div>\n      <ul>\n        <li>at least three <b>passives</b>, with the doer left out where it adds nothing</li>\n        <li>two real figures, and a modifier that matches each change</li>\n        <li><b>It used to be&hellip; Now it is&hellip;</b> in one sentence</li>\n        <li>the turn, marked with <b>On the other hand&hellip;</b></li>\n        <li>a conclusion that does not simply repeat the opening</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ============ PART 8 · SPEAKING ============ -->\n    <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 8 &middot; Speaking &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">assessed against the criteria</span></div>\n    <div class=\"opentask speak\" data-open data-tid=\"test-speak\">\n      <div class=\"sp-head\"><span class=\"sp-ic\">&#127908;</span>\n        <div><b>Speaking &mdash; describe the change, then argue about sport</b><span>Extended turn</span></div></div>\n      <p class=\"sp-task\"><b>Part A.</b> Describe the same place out loud in ninety seconds, without reading. <b>Part B.</b> Then take a side: <i>should schools bring back competitive sports days?</i> Argue for it, then argue against it, and say which case you find stronger.</p>\n      <ul class=\"sp-list\">\n        <li>three passives, and one deliberate <i>by</i> + doer where the doer is the news</li>\n        <li>two modifiers of different sizes for two different changes</li>\n        <li>general statements with no article, and specific ones with <i>the</i></li>\n        <li>one recommendation, softened</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"sp-lang\"><b>Use this language</b>It was built in&hellip; &middot; It has been turned into&hellip; &middot; It used to be&hellip; &middot; These days&hellip; &middot; There&rsquo;s been a sharp fall in&hellip; &middot; If I were you, I&rsquo;d&hellip;</div>\n      <div class=\"rec\">\n        <div class=\"rec-row\">\n          <button class=\"rec-btn\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"recToggle(this)\" aria-label=\"Record your answer\" title=\"Record\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 14a3 3 0 0 0 3-3V6a3 3 0 0 0-6 0v5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3zm5-3a5 5 0 0 1-10 0H5a7 7 0 0 0 6 6.9V21h2v-3.1A7 7 0 0 0 19 11z\"/></svg></button>\n          <div class=\"rec-label\"><b>Record your answer</b><span>Press the microphone and speak</span></div>\n          <div class=\"rec-wave\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n          <div class=\"rec-time\">0:00</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rec-takes\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rec-note\">Record it, play it back, then submit it for assessment.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:30px\">Parts 7 and 8 &middot; Assessment</div>\n    <p class=\"subline\">These two parts are not marked automatically and they are not marked by you. Submit your writing and record your speaking, then your teacher &mdash; or the AI tutor &mdash; scores each part against the criteria below and writes the feedback.</p>\n    <div class=\"rubric-slot\">\n      <ul class=\"reqlist\">\n        <li>my report gives the &lsquo;then&rsquo; before the &lsquo;now&rsquo;</li>\n        <li>it contains at least two real figures</li>\n        <li>every modifier matches the size of the change it describes</li>\n        <li>I named who lost out, not only who gained</li>\n        <li>my passives leave the doer out unless the doer is the news</li>\n        <li>my general statements have no article and my specific ones have <i>the</i></li>\n        <li>I argued both sides before saying which was stronger</li>\n        <li>I spoke for ninety seconds without reading</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n"}